<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαψ-ίδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			v. infr.), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάψ</span> B)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vain, false</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ᾽ ἐμὸν ὄνομα . . μαψίδιον ἔχει
					φάτιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					251
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.188
				</span></i>
			; <i>useless, worthless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαψιδίη κόνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.602
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαψιδίως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάψ</span>
			, <i>thoughtlessly, at random</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.374
			</span></i>, al.; <i>without reason</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεχολῶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.310
				</span></i>
			; <i>rashly, recklessly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.365
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἀλάλησθε</span>, of pirates,
				<i><span class="en">
				3.72
			</span></i>.</div>
